# a suspected 2/2 with menace that can't block (CR 701.60a, 701.60c, 613.4c). When Bot1's Memnite attacks, Bot2's Memnite may
# not block it, while Bot2's Ornithopter (the positive control) may. The ability that returns the Aura from the graveyard is
# refused while it is on the battlefield (CR 113.6k).

